{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"736446567862632508","content":"Traxim gets up after a very long sleep and feels compelled to put the foolishness of London behind him. It been weird to be so close to his shop and not doing any work. After grabbing a shower and getting dressed, he starts taking out tools and working on several projects at once. He had spotted Wren sleeping in her bunk so he tries to be as quiet as possible including when he talked to himself. “If I could get these to line up more precisely it would be done. Or maybe I could just boost the power another way...”","created_at":"2020-07-25T15:04:49.917000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736599851315363850","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
